  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The gas is Chloro-fluoro carbon. In presence of UV radiation it follows free radical mechanism. Formation of free radical as intermediate occurs due to homolytic fission of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Cl</mi></math>&nbsp;bond.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e869dcf0-f276-4ef8-8ab3-acdd7a723c32-image.png\" style=\"width: 399px; height: 92px;\" /></p>",
